即便每日都沉浸在恩爱之中，可人生也不过短短百年。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/cc/cc210a5ab5f5454e4109fb64b8a20a67b8c02640b00b3d317f3b2205fe817881.mp3"},{"voiceId":"96c17cee-c019-42ed-b51a-a9e96bbf22a4","displayName":"小撒 · 明亮","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["明亮"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"五千年文化，三千年诗韵。人生如一场修行，得意时，一日看尽长安花。艰难时，潦倒新停浊酒杯。但生命的跋涉不能回头，哪怕畏途巉岩不可攀，也要会当凌绝顶。哪怕无人会登临意，也要猛志固常在。从经典中汲取九万里风鹏正举的力量。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/af/af2b2e77188c7b70aec256bde53e9d3ef5798fcd32b1cd5f5303198b7ca86123.mp3"},{"voiceId":"fe85a513-9bf3-4ef7-aa0b-8b2d11e4db93","displayName":"少年感人声 · 温柔","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["温柔"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"第二天，弗洛格又来了。他放下一束野花失望地转身走了。走了几步后停下来回头望了一眼门没有开。他有些失落。而这时门开了，小鸭开心地抱起画和花，看着弗洛格走远。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/69/69896b179859a378d424db703a6c4839fb0c83837be972071aad5f7394a449f1.mp3"},{"voiceId":"283f7917-a891-456b-9c3a-1182bc650f1d","displayName":"巴中 · 沉稳","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"在巴中拥有 1000㎡场地，怎么打造当地独一份、不内卷的新一代游乐场？","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/59/59b28890abe6f6863fc29dcdab5a1b3a6fe90f9e2382afb8eacd1bc5c764d655.mp3"},{"voiceId":"e7f39411-8602-43a3-b2fc-d0f68d72df17","displayName":"干净青男旁白 · 明亮","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["明亮"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"想到洛丹一次又一次让他震惊，出乎他的意料，给他带来惊喜，又让他生气的样子。再想到等下能好好借机教育一下洛丹，让他知道一下什么叫天高地厚。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/6f/6f0b2ad362e802ee1d4c7855c49391160a7a6244c5713d6e5dc913a32df79368.mp3"},{"voiceId":"2e9cd7c9-5d85-4648-988f-1d20924c173b