大唐期盼的将是一位公主的灵视。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/f0/f0afeb099aa8bc36707ddb90ffa226ec240976b7730ba738bf57a42f9b21273d.mp3"},{"voiceId":"2fdf194e-c16e-4587-9027-0d3464e09b4e","displayName":"诗词朗读 · 沉稳","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"今天我为大家诵读和赏析的是唐代诗人杜甫的作品。绝句，两个黄鹂鸣翠柳，一行白鹭上青天，窗含西岭千秋雪，门泊东吴万里船。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/13/133c6ec454e79d16a2e10c7cacbd8fe6d39b5f156b0497d88fdb08c048fea7ca.mp3"},{"voiceId":"17fe57e2-0c65-4d68-a3ac-efccd1e52183","displayName":"说书男声 · 沉稳","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"那是前两天的事儿，我去老街那家理发店，老王师傅跟我说起以前的事儿，那时候理发才五块钱，还能给你擦擦肩膀捶捶背。现在呢价格涨了，但那份热情还在。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/aa/aac2c96d89e033d79558ed5e537388af666e185544ea9461690fb024a63d2442.mp3"},{"voiceId":"398d06e3-87bc-471d-8b9b-da30a7f5c4b6","displayName":"说服力广告青男音 · 沉稳","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"选用来自北纬三十七度黄金产区的优质小麦，经过传统工艺烘焙，成就了这款饼干酥脆可口的口感。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/90/90ef76c5148cc9a45dd755a9bc3ad9b5b8d6a21a9d0c1c57b5bf0b7f5c6194b7.mp3"},{"voiceId":"6e47713c-c78f-47f6-89db-f2746aad0d0f","displayName":"软糯女声 · 专业","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["专业"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"今天已经结束了，不用再回想，也不需要计划。明天呼吸自然的变轻，你可以安心休息了。有人替你守着这一刻。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/7f/7f0176605270e769522d33781d970310247595cb26cc9894ed52050414c3179c.mp3"},{"voiceId":"212db44c-cb14-58dc-92bc-03e395d1dced","displayName":"连环画旁白 · 沉稳","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"风从草原深处吹来，带着岁月的苍茫与希望。一个小小的身影，在辽阔天地间慢慢长大，用坚韧对抗艰难，用善良温暖时光。那些走过的坎坷，都化作成长的勋章；那些不曾低头的日子，终将让生命，在阳光下开出最勇敢的花。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/eb/ebe08960e9e5d67d356fb4f871ab8c3f48f110fd43c7215801b017e6b85447eb.mp3"},{"voiceId":"16a60cbd-ef31-49d2-9162-f991d780dfd3","displayName":"逗叔说三国 · 沉稳","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"赤壁之战后，鲁肃奉孙权之命，千方百计要向蜀汉讨回荆州。为此，鲁肃与临江亭邀请镇守荆州的关羽赴宴，预设伏兵，想以威逼要挟的手段要回荆州。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/ce/ce4db06b4e9496d5fb0b5875f703b440a225bb9f12c82439f289d6500fe50b6d.mp3"},{"voiceId":"de9f59d8-50be-4371-9fc7-d6cbeec856c3","displayName":"配音小军老师 · 沉稳","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"它是新时代空军现代化建设的重要里程碑,是捍卫祖国领空的尖端利器。歼20战机以其超音速巡航能力和隐身特性,成为我国空军跨入世界一流行列的有力见证。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/22/222743b50d44fa5a452fedc75f1eb838ac29649330ab3d153a422900fd40ff9b.mp3"},{"voiceId":"d6b2b916-a5a9-4b4d-930d-455f0a6504b2","displayName":"酷感女童音 · 自然","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["自然"],"gender":"female","referenceText":"没关系，就算蛋糕烧焦了，我可以做一个沙拉呀。","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/49/4985d58664b720935ce71e75a46fa8304177d4dee3d3893256aa245bc4f8e3bb.mp3"},{"voiceId":"04d60079-1edf-4161-a55a-6a045721fb25","displayName":"香港电台男主播 · 沉稳","locale":"旁白","category":"旁白","matchedScenes":["旁白"],"styleLabels":["沉稳"],"gender":"male","referenceText":"由零开始,其实唔系一句口号。一个人经历过高峰,经历过误会,甚至经历过跌落谷底之后,仲肯重新企返起身,嗰种心境系完全唔同嘅。以前我会问,点样先可以赢?今日我反而会问,点样先可以放低?","audio_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jwoo1982217-eng/moting-voice-materials-20261009/main/audio/